    "center"
   ],
   "description": "Rotate EARTH-RELATIVE halo winds (uz,vm) back to A-grid COVARIANT (ua tile-x covariant) at each halo cell -- step 4 of the Mouallem 2023 vector halo remap, after scalar duo_extend fills the earth-relative components across seams. V=uz*elon+vm*elat then dotted with the node-tangent basis (from duo_cell_center); the tangent x/y neighbour is the +1 cell, or -1 with a sign flip at the outermost halo cell gi/gj=N+6. Params [uz,vm,center]; bind center=duo_cell_center; R_sphere free name.",
